WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:06.662
The yes or no tarot spread uses three cards to
weigh a decision rather than predict it.

00:00:06.662 --> 00:00:11.370
It sets out the case for, the case
against, and what might tip the balance.

00:00:12.670 --> 00:00:14.693
What the cards can and can't answer.

00:00:14.693 --> 00:00:22.167
Tarot has no way of knowing what will happen, so a card cannot tell you
whether you will get the job or whether a plan will work out.

00:00:23.467 --> 00:00:24.592
The three positions.

00:00:24.592 --> 00:00:28.134
The case for yes, the case against, then
what tips the balance.

00:00:29.534 --> 00:00:31.973
Have a tarot spread in front of you?

00:00:31.973 --> 00:00:36.918
Photograph it at readmyspread.com, and get
a clear reading, card by card.
